WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.330
The word "biodynamic" may be quickly misinterpreted.

2
00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:13.000
The way I would like you to interpret it in relation to my course, is that I explain ontogenetic developmental movement.

3
00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:19.300
This is what I call biodynamics, the dynamics of life.

4
00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:29.040
And how, somehow, it is organized by a creative genius, which can give rise to a kind of emergence of originality, like that, which appears.

5
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.240
It's quite wonderful, ultimately.

6
00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:41.597
Now, you know, I think, a complement to the craniosacral system, which was perhaps simply anatomical at first, which now perhaps becomes embryological and dynamic.

